{"text": "Báwo ni o ṣe wà?", "note": "how are you"}
{"text": "Ẹ ṣé gan-an ni.", "note": "thank you very much"}
{"text": "Mo fẹ́ lọ sí ọjà.", "note": "i want to go to the market"}
{"text": "Mo fẹ́ mu omi.", "note": "i want to drink water"}
{"text": "Kí ni orúkọ rẹ?", "note": "what is your name"}
{"text": "Ọmọ náà ń lọ sí ilé ìwé.", "note": "the child is going to school"}
{"text": "A dúpẹ́ lọ́wọ́ Ọlọ́run.", "note": "we thank God"}
{"text": "Ẹ kú àárọ̀.", "note": "good morning"}
